* Auto-generated testbench for RC filter: R711/C711
* Type: low-pass, expected fc = 15915.5 Hz
* Model: ideal passives (exact for RC)


R711 NTC_A_RAW NTC_PHASE_A 1k

C711 NTC_PHASE_A 0 10n

* AC stimulus
VAC NTC_A_RAW 0 DC 0 AC 1

.ac dec 100 159.2 1.592Meg
.meas ac fc_sim when vdb(NTC_PHASE_A)=-3
.meas ac phase_fc find vp(NTC_PHASE_A) at=fc_sim

.end
